      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 10:11 a.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0001-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 25,
        "start": 25
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: So, if there's a Martian invasion, there would be an exception for that."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0001-0003",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 26,
        "start": 26
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "A Rule 23(f) petition for permission to seek interlocutory appeal, if that cannot proceed, they have their full right of appeal at the end of the case."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0001-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 36,
        "start": 36
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: What -- what did you understand the district court to be saying when it set the motion for reconsideration?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court of Appeals",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0002-0000",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 45,
        "start": 45
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "the decertification order was made on February 20. There was no Rule 23(f) petition filed within that 14-day period."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Herstoff",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0002-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 46,
        "start": 46
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "I think it -- it is a unique circumstance where the district court misadvises the party on how much time -\u00ad"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0002-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 49,
        "start": 49
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Has this Court cast any doubt on Thompson?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Herstoff",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0002-0005",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 52,
        "start": 52
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "court did mislead Mr. Lambert into thinking that he had -\u00ad"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0002-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 53,
        "start": 53
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "How would you distinguish what happened here from a local rule that's longer than 14 days?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0002-0006",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 57,
        "start": 57
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The leave to file a motion -- the motion for leave to file an appeal, you didn't tell the judge you were intending to do that, did you?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "61d8ad09811473001f2cbbf4df463890c1dfb4c3bdb6097391fe56182f7840b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-61d8ad098114-0002-0010",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 60,
        "start": 60
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Rule 23(f) petition was filed 14 days later, and the appeal, therefore, was improperly deemed timely."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Source extraction",
      "case_id": "2018-17-1094",
      "confidence": 0.0,
